    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "The selling pages are silent"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The homepage (Corporation) and blog posts (BlogPosting) carry schema. /platform, /demo-request, every use-case and comparison page don't."
    },
